      "padding": 32,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "odHvo",
          "name": "Heading",
          "fill": "$graphite",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "BRIEF — Capture · desktop (as-is)",
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "TVGLq",
          "name": "Body",
          "fill": "$graphite",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "kit-version-source: 0.1.0 · brief-schema: 1 · updated: 2026-09-27\n1. PURPOSE\nThe same start at a desk.\n2. ENTRY POINTS\n- Opening the app with no design: Home — src/ui/App.tsx (Screen)\n- \"Nuevo diseño\" on Home or in the Studio header\n3. SCREENS (left → right)\n- Home · Measures with the simulated-expert banner · Measures · Photos, empty · Photos, description only · Analyzing\n4. BUSINESS RULES\n- Measures: alto/ancho 200–2400 mm, fondo 150–1200 mm; \"No sé las medidas\" skips them (D26) — src/ui/capture/Capture.tsx:21\n- Front and 3/4 photos are required, the rest suggested — Capture.tsx:13\n- Without photos, the description needs 15+ characters — Capture.tsx:29 (MIN_DESCRIPTION)\n- With no API key only the simulated expert answers; the banner asks to connect one first (D27)\n- Analyzing shows the real stages and a clock; after 30 s it explains the wait — src/ui/capture/Analyzing.tsx\n5. COPY SOURCE\nsrc/ui/capture/{Home,Capture,Analyzing,Silhouettes}.tsx, src/ui/system/TakePhoto.tsx\n6. STATES NOT DRAWN\n- A taken photo with its note, a failed analysis with retry and \"Ver qué pasó\" — need a real provider or a fixture photo\n- \"Intento 2 de 3\" correcting, the piece-by-piece wait — only with a real expert\n7. OPEN FINDINGS\nUI-7, UI-8, UI-19\n8. HISTORY\n→ LOG frame, bottom of this file.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
