          "content": "kit-version-source: 0.1.0 · brief-schema: 1 · updated: 2026-09-27\nAPPROVED 2026-09-27 — not in code yet. When it lands, this band replaces the as-is band above and the as-is captures are retaken.\n1. PURPOSE\nStart a design with less scrolling and nothing unlabeled.\n2. ENTRY POINTS\nSame as the as-is band.\n3. SCREENS (left → right)\n- Measures — \"Tipo de mueble\" leaves this step (UI-7); the tape ruler stays\n- Photos, empty — one \"Agregar fotos\", up to 5 (D39)\n- Photos, three added — views labeled by the model, notes in sight, \"3 de 5\" (D39)\n4. BUSINESS RULES\nD39 (proposal): no required photos; the expert asks for a missing view; photos are read when added.\n5. COPY SOURCE\nsrc/ui/capture/Capture.tsx, src/ui/system/KindSelect.tsx. NEW copy: \"Agregar fotos\", \"hasta 5\", \"3 de 5\", \"Agregar una nota\". Thumbnails are 3D renders standing in for photos.\n6. STATES NOT DRAWN\nDesktop target · correcting a wrong view label · a failed reading · the simulated-expert banner.\n7. OPEN FINDINGS\nUI-7, UI-8, UI-19 · D39\n8. HISTORY\n→ LOG frame, below.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
